 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Adjacent digits may be swapped only when both are odd or both are even, any number of times. Return the largest string obtainable. Because a digit can never pass one of the other parity, every maximal run of same-parity digits can be rearranged freely and is sorted in descending order; nothing else changes.",
